==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} for “he is ill”, 3rd person singular form of the verb {{term|aegrotare}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{1811}} A [[certificate]] indicating that a student is ill, excusing him or her from lectures and examinations and allowing him to pass courses for which he is too ill to finish the required materials.

